{
  "an7.58:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 7.58 ",
  "an7.58:0.2": "6. Abyākatavagga ",
  "an7.58:0.3": "Arakkheyyasutta ",
  "an7.58:1.1": "“Cattārimāni, bhikkhave, tathāgatassa arakkheyyāni, tīhi ca anupavajjo. ",
  "an7.58:1.2": "Katamāni cattāri tathāgatassa arakkheyyāni? ",
  "an7.58:1.3": "Parisuddhakāyasamācāro, bhikkhave, tathāgato; ",
  "an7.58:1.4": "natthi tathāgatassa kāyaduccaritaṁ yaṁ tathāgato rakkheyya: ",
  "an7.58:1.5": "‘mā me idaṁ paro aññāsī’ti. ",
  "an7.58:2.1": "Parisuddhavacīsamācāro, bhikkhave, tathāgato; ",
  "an7.58:2.2": "natthi tathāgatassa vacīduccaritaṁ yaṁ tathāgato rakkheyya: ",
  "an7.58:2.3": "‘mā me idaṁ paro aññāsī’ti. ",
  "an7.58:3.1": "Parisuddhamanosamācāro, bhikkhave, tathāgato; ",
  "an7.58:3.2": "natthi tathāgatassa manoduccaritaṁ yaṁ tathāgato rakkheyya: ",
  "an7.58:3.3": "‘mā me idaṁ paro aññāsī’ti. ",
  "an7.58:4.1": "Parisuddhājīvo, bhikkhave, tathāgato; ",
  "an7.58:4.2": "natthi tathāgatassa micchāājīvo yaṁ tathāgato rakkheyya: ",
  "an7.58:4.3": "‘mā me idaṁ paro aññāsī’ti. ",
  "an7.58:5.1": "Imāni cattāri tathāgatassa arakkheyyāni. ",
  "an7.58:6.1": "Katamehi tīhi anupavajjo? ",
  "an7.58:6.2": "Svākkhātadhammo, bhikkhave, tathāgato. ",
  "an7.58:6.3": "Tatra vata maṁ samaṇo vā brāhmaṇo vā devo vā māro vā brahmā vā koci vā lokasmiṁ sahadhammena paṭicodessati: ",
  "an7.58:6.4": "‘itipi tvaṁ na svākkhātadhammo’ti. ",
  "an7.58:6.5"